      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RAMJET (8) showed good early burn and was there until turning but swamped late to finish 6th at Maitland in Grade 5 company. Was a winner at his only start from this draw. Has ability and looks hard to stop. BLAZING PRINCE (7) gave a start after copping a check in running and missed the frame when a 12 length fourth (23.66) at Richmond in a Grade 5. Can measure up this time. POSSIBLE (1) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (23.33) at this track behind At The Gate in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from six attempts. Expected to be in this for a long way. IBROX MAVERICK (3) is in the mix despite finishing out of the placings here last start.",
